Determination of Aflatoxin and Heavy Metal Levels in Some Spices Sold as Unpackaged
in Van Province and Health Risks Assessment of Heavy Metals
Ufuk MERCAN YÜCEL

1

Van Yüzüncü Yıl University, Faculty of Veterinary Medicine, Department of Pharmacology and Toxicology

1

Geliş Tarihi / Received: 11.08.2022,

